SDV simple:

VSS :
    Sensor Signal Camera :
            trigger period 150ms+/-10ms offset 0ms+/-0ms
            latency 30ms+/-10ms
    Actuator Signal Brake :
            trigger period 100ms+/-1ms offset 0ms+/-0ms
            latency 30ms+/-10ms
App :
    Component AEB_controler :
        Service S1 :
            subscribe to
                - var VSS.Camera
            publish to
                - VSS.Brake
            trigger period 200ms+/-10ms offset 10ms+/-0ms
            execution 50ms+/-15ms

Functional Chains:
    chain : Camera -> S1 -> Brake